     2| * IVX Landing Full Deploy — pushes ALL landing static files to S3 + invalidates CloudFront.
     3| *
     4| * Unlike the SEO autodeployer (which intentionally skips index.html), this endpoint
     5| * deploys every file in expo/ivxholding-landing/ including the main index.html,
